00:35:06.060 --> 00:35:21.880
Richard Bair: official documentation for the design of the consensus layer of a consensus node. Consensus nodes are split into two parts. There's the consensus part, and then there's the execution part. Consensus is responsible for gossip and running the Hashgraph.

